  "headline": "Sekolah Rakyat Program Expansion Gains Momentum Across Indonesia",
  "seoTitle": "Sekolah Rakyat Program Expansion Indonesia",
  "metaDescription": "The Sekolah Rakyat initiative is expanding across Indonesia, reporting significant progress in reducing out-of-school youth and supporting local communities.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Sekolah Rakyat program continues to expand in regions including Lombok Utara, Temanggung, and Pekanbaru to support out-of-school youth.",
    "Data indicates a 32.37 percent reduction in the number of out-of-school children in West Java throughout 2026.",
    "The program serves diverse participants, including former domestic workers and shop assistants seeking to improve their educational credentials."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Sekolah Rakyat initiative is a community-based education program currently receiving attention for its role in reducing the number of children and youth outside the formal schooling system. Recent reports highlight its expansion into various Indonesian regions, including Kediri, Pekanbaru, and Lombok Utara, where local parents have noted increased access for their children. In West Java, officials reported a significant 32.37 percent decrease in out-of-school youth as of November 2026. The program has gained support from various stakeholders, including Bappenas, which identifies the initiative as a tool for achieving Sustainable Development Goals. Participants in the program range from former domestic workers to shop assistants who are leveraging these educational opportunities to change their career trajectories. Meanwhile, local governments are actively preparing facilities and infrastructure, such as land allocation in Temanggung, to support the ongoing implementation of these integrated schooling models.",
